00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:46,100
Help me!

251
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:48,200
Please call somebody, Father!

252
00:15:49,660 --> 00:15:51,131
I need medical attention!

253
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:54,800
83, 89, 97.

254
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:57,220
If you want me, I'm right here.

255
00:15:57,980 --> 00:15:59,377
Just open the door.

256
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:02,357
You must know if I'm able to
leave here and call for help,

257
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,357
you can get treatment right away.

258
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:06,911
That is what you were thinking, is it not?

259
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:11,845
If so, why would you not make it a priority
to move in the direction of my voice?

260
00:16:16,420 --> 00:16:17,250
Father!

261
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:24,000
The disc that contains
Shotaro Kujo Star Platinum.

262
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:26,697
Exactly what should I do about it now?

263
00:16:26,780 --> 00:16:30,477
I took care of Jolene, but I can't
just leave her in the courtyard.

264
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,260
Did the gate finally open?

265
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,932
Please take me with you.

266
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:37,380
Father? Hello? Father?

267
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,520
Where are you?

268
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:41,837
This is my limit.

269
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:44,120
I can't hold back the poison anymore.

270
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,980
And I dropped the disc.

271
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,165
I don't even know where it is.

272
00:17:04,220 --> 00:17:10,657
the rain has stopped but
where is Jolene Kujo's

273
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:14,980
lifeless body if I find
her I should find the disc

274
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:18,177
I was frightened there
for a moment but there

275
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:22,540
is no way frogs can defeat
a snake search for it

276
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:26,917
Palesnake's range of movement
is barely 20 meters at best

277
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,660
I'm running a huge risk by even
being here If someone sees me,

278
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,740
all bets are off

279
00:17:32,500 --> 00:17:34,220
But there's no other way

280
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:41,877
The soul of a deceased criminal
returns to Earth in the form of a

281
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:45,477
frog In the name of trying to bring
its companions to the land of the

282
00:17:45,560 --> 00:17:48,997
dead I have heard that in the East
there are stories of a similar

283
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:53,300
nature but this horror is truly the
personification of that proverb.

284
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:57,471
Nonetheless, the disc I seek
must be around here somewhere.

285
00:17:58,100 --> 00:17:59,218
Listen, Pale Snake.

286
00:17:59,660 --> 00:18:03,857
I want you to sweep the area between where
you are and the entrance to the gate.

287
00:18:03,940 --> 00:18:06,017
The guard may have taken it earlier.

288
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,924
It should be in that direction.

289
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:11,520
Ah, here it is!

290
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:16,260
I have retrieved the disc.

291
00:18:17,060 --> 00:18:18,060
Thanks a lot.

292
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:21,105
I've been waiting for
you to find where it was.

293
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:33,390
Goddammit!

294
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,940
This is so gross.

295
00:18:35,260 --> 00:18:36,840
They're all over my face.

296
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:38,549
Makes me want to throw up!

297
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:42,677
The poison only comes out when
the frogs splatter on impact.

298
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,837
So if they don't explode,
they're harmless.

299
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:47,680
That's why I made a net using live frogs,

300
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:51,273
in order to lessen the impact
of the frogs still falling.

301
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,911
Which allowed me to lay in wait
for you to locate the disk.

302
00:18:56,100 --> 00:18:57,660
It doesn't matter!

303
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:00,500
You lost!

304
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:02,320
Accept your fate and die!

305
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,180
Actually, it was already here.

306
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:17,237
The Speedwagon Foundation's
messenger wasn't human.

307
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:21,580
You just didn't even see that
it was here right on time.

308
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:24,497
Weaving through the deadly
rain of frogs like an angel,

309
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:26,286
it made it to this courtyard.

310
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:28,497
Savage Guardian is the
name of that pigeon.

311
00:19:28,580 --> 00:19:33,462
And like all trained carrier pigeons, it
will bring the disc to its rightful place.

312
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:37,420
Hail Snake!

313
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:40,717
The gun that the guard dropped
earlier is still over near the gate!

314
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:42,565
Blow that bird out of the sky!

315
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,360
Ugh, idiotic guard!

316
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,617
He completely emptied the clip of bullets!

317
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:50,530
Damn it!

318
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,960
I won.

319
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:57,037
Don't underestimate me, you insolent brat!

320
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:58,660
This changes nothing!

321
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:00,757
Even with Star Platinum Return,

322
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:03,037
your father would be nothing
more than a broken puppet!

323
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:06,237
He will never be able to recognize
you as his own daughter again!

324
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:08,120
This little game is over!

325
00:20:08,660 --> 00:20:09,490
Hey, look!

326
00:20:09,573 --> 00:20:11,177
There's a guard knocked out over there!

327
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:13,977
Don't step on the frauds,
and check the courtyard!

328
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,707
There might be someone else!

329
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:19,580
No, not yet.

330
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:21,260
I can't faint here.

331
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:24,091
The stand user has to be nearby somewhere.

332
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:27,560
I have to find out who
Palesnake really is.

333
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,885
And the user still has
my father's memory disk.

334
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:35,588
Now's the best chance I'm gonna
get to discover who they are!

335
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:37,930
Hey!

336
00:20:38,013 --> 00:20:39,232
Look outside the window!

337
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:41,220
Oh my god! Unbelievable!

338
00:20:41,620 --> 00:20:42,914
It's a bloody miracle!

339
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,619
But who's gonna clean up this mess?

340
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:47,440
Nothing has changed at all.

341
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:50,957
The only reason I stole Star
Platinum in the first place was

342
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:54,760
to defeat Jotaro Kujo and avenge
the death of my best friend.

343
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:59,891
What matters most is the memory disk,
and it still remains in my possession.

344
00:21:00,060 --> 00:21:02,000
Everything is going as planned.

345
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:07,049
The instructions on how to reach heaven
can only be found in Jotaro's memory.

346
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:19,837
An abnormal occurrence
where frogs rain down

347
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:22,508
from the sky solely in
the prison courtyard.

348
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:28,157
Through the chaos of
this unexplainable event,

349
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:31,005
Jolene's attempt at
escaping went unquestioned.

350
00:21:33,700 --> 00:21:35,641
And thanks to a feathered friend,

351
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:38,157
the Speedwagon Foundation
obtained the disc

352
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:40,940
which contains Jotaro
Kujo's Star Platinum.

353
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:46,520
However, without the memory disc, Jotaro's
mind and soul will never be restored.

354
00:21:58,280 --> 00:22:02,057
Although you think I cope

355
00:22:02,140 --> 00:22:07,240
My head is filled with hope

356
00:22:08,780 --> 00:22:15,760
Of some place other than here

357
00:22:18,520 --> 00:22:22,197
Although you think I smile

358
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:27,240
Inside and all the while

359
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:35,360
I'm wondering About my destiny

360
00:22:38,060 --> 00:22:41,380
I'm thinking about

361
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:50,037
All the things I'd

362
00:22:50,120 --> 00:22:56,500
like to do in my life

363
00:22:57,940 --> 00:23:01,317
I'm a dreamer,

364
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:06,360
a distant dreamer

365
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:11,420
Dreaming for all

366
00:23:15,420 --> 00:23:16,580
From today

367
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:25,900
Sports Maximum This is the bone
that I want to ask you about

368
00:23:27,180 --> 00:23:31,062
Using your unique abilities There
is something I would like to try

369
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:32,430
Really?

370
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:34,200
Does that belong to a human?

371
00:23:34,680 --> 00:23:35,797
Whose bone is it?

372
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:38,037
That answer is none of your business.

373
00:23:38,120 --> 00:23:41,120
Let's just say it belongs
to an old friend of mine.

374
00:23:41,280 --> 00:23:45,000
The bone of my dear friend, the Great Dio.

375
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:06,710
Thank you.

376
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,880
Thank you.
